🌀 Day 33: Fibonacci Series Generator — Loop + Recursive Versions

📌 Project Overview

Day 33 is part of Phase 3: Functions, File Handling, and Exceptions in my Python learning journey.

In this project, I built a Fibonacci series generator using two different approaches:

Loop version: Generates a list of the first n Fibonacci numbers using a for loop.
Recursive version: Calculates the n-th Fibonacci number using a function that calls itself.

The program displays the complete series generated by the loop and the n-th Fibonacci number calculated through recursion.

It also handles zero and negative inputs and allows the user to generate multiple series until they enter q to quit.

